+# Free-Text Veterinarian Search Stays Out; Narrowing the Directory by Specialty Comes In
+
+**Status:** Accepted
+
+## Context
+
+NG-9 declined searching for a pet, a visit, or a veterinarian, leaving owners as the only searchable records. The row was derived from observed absence during the 2026-07-31 bootstrap survey, so its provenance was open. A request to narrow the veterinarian directory by specialty touched that row: a reader could take narrowing for a form of searching.
+
+The owner decided the row on 2026-10-25, in the intake for `REQ-VET-003`:
+
+> Non-goal NG-9 is narrowed: free-text veterinarian search stays out of scope, but filtering the directory by an attribute it already shows is in.
+
+## Options Considered
+
+1. **Keep NG-9 whole.** Treat any narrowing of the directory as search and decline it. Rejected by the owner: the directory already shows each veterinarian's specialties, and narrowing by one adds no new kind of lookup.
+2. **Drop NG-9 for veterinarians.** Open free-text veterinarian search as well. Rejected by the owner: free-text search stays out of scope.
+3. **Narrow NG-9** (chosen). Free-text veterinarian search stays declined; narrowing the directory by an attribute it already shows is in scope.
+
+## Decision
+
+NG-9 keeps declining free-text search for a veterinarian. Narrowing the veterinarian directory by an attribute it already shows is in scope, and specialty is the first such narrowing. The owner did not touch the pet and visit parts of the row. They stay as the survey recorded them.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- The directory can be narrowed to the veterinarians holding one named specialty, on both the page and the machine-readable list.
+- Free-text veterinarian search remains declined. A request for it needs a fresh owner decision.
+- The pet and visit parts of NG-9 remain part of the open provenance consultation.
+
+## Implementation
+
+**Non-goal:** NG-9
+
+- [PRD Non-Goals](../prd.md#non-goals): the narrowed row.
+- [PRD Veterinarian directory](../prd.md#req-vet-003): the specialty narrowing now in scope.
